---

# 64. Pull Request Gate

A merge should require appropriate automated checks:

```text
lint
type checks
unit tests
component tests
contract tests
security checks
build
```

as defined by Document 14.

---

# 65. Build Pipeline

The build process should:

```text
install dependencies
validate code
run tests
build artifacts
build container
scan dependencies/image
publish versioned artifact
```

---

# 66. Deployment Pipeline

Deployment should be environment-aware.

Conceptually:

```text
Commit
 ↓
CI
 ↓
Test
 ↓
Development
 ↓
Test
 ↓
Staging
 ↓
Approval
 ↓
Production
